The size of impedance cannot simply be understood as the bigger the better or the smaller the better, the key is matching.
Regarding the control parameters of impedance, the control requirements can be achieved through mutual adjustment during production.
After lamination in production, slice and analyze the board. If the thickness of the medium is reduced, the line width can be reduced to meet the requirements; if the thickness is too thick, the copper can be thickened to reduce the impedance value.
