News - Summarizing the main causes and analyzing feasible solutions during in the process of SMT
The following article will highlight the main reasons and solutions for throwing materials sorted by technicians’ production experience: 1.Problems of suction nozzle, such as deformation, blockage and damage of suction nozzle, resulting in insufficient air pressure and air leakage, resulting in inability to absorb materials, incorrect reclaiming, failure of identification, and PCBA throwing.
The feeder is not set correctly, the position is deformed, and the feeding mechanism is poor, resulting in insufficient reclaiming or PCBA throwing due to poor reclaiming.
3.A problem with the recognition system, poor vision, unclean vision or laser lens, foreign objects interfere with the recognition, improper selection of recognition light source or insufficient intensity and gray scale, or the recognition system may be broken.
4.Position problem, position offset, the suction nozzle is not in the center of the material when sucking and reclaiming, and the reclaiming height is incorrect (generally 0.05mm after touching the part), resulting in deviation, incorrect reclaiming and offset. When identifying, it is inconsistent with the corresponding data parameters and is discarded by the identification system as invalid material.
5.Vacuum problem, insufficient air pressure, unsmooth vacuum gas pipe channel, foreign matter blocking the vacuum pipe, or vacuum leakage, resulting in insufficient air pressure and unable to pick up materials, or falling on the way to paste after picking up.
