Positional accuracy: With the size of components decrease, the positional accuracy of both inspection equipment and manufacturing are increasingly important. And AOI system should have sub-pixel accuracy as a rule-of-thumb, which make sure the there is enough accurate for the system to detect the small deviations in position that can result in a 01005 defect.
Multiple inspection objects: AOI test not only works well used in PCBs, but also for PCB assembly. As to PCB, it checks the defects, for example, shorts, opens and insufficient solder.
