It is important that the logos can be consistent with the theme of the game and that they are easy to remember, but the truth is that roblox As the beginning of their gaming processes since 2004, they have had several changes in their logo until they reach the one we currently know.
This was the first logo known from roblox, there is reflected the beta of the game that was from 2004 to 2005, we can see that it was a logo with colors similar to those of Google, making interaction and emphasis on being a virtual product, although the truth is that it is not he had a lot of personality.
Then in 2005 it was decided to change the logo to this one, with letters of a single color matching between red and white and with the word beta in blue, here the TM had already been removed from its first logo.
The second official logo of roblox It was this, which continued with the red line, now more intense due to the filling of its letters, I present the first 'O' of its name in a square shape reflecting the theme of its worlds, this was created on December 10, 2016 and it was kept until July 2019.
