Users are required to create their own character and, whether male or female, the custom creation can be seen totally naked.
To censor nudity in Rust, players must press the F2 key in-game for the settings overlay to appear. They will then need to scroll down and look for the "Censor Nudity" option, which should then be activated.
Scroll down and find the 'Censor Nudity' setting.
Press F2 to access the settings overlay.
Turn off the option to enable nude characters.
