So through this article We will be talking to you about what these slips are, And we will also explain how to do them in the best way.
The slips are those little speed impulses that your vehicle can receive for a short period of time. They are very beneficial, since thanks to them you can take advantage of to overtake your rivals.
The functionality of these slips is that you can gain a little boost plus speed for your vehicle, and thus get ahead of the race.
Making a slipstream is really easy, you just have to stand behind your opponent for a few seconds, As the seconds pass you will be able to find the impulse and thus overtake it.
since when it occurs, there is a small effect similar to the air that will begin to appear next to our vehicle. So if you stay like this for about three seconds, you are sure to gain the speed boost, and you can even push your opponent to the side.
You already know how beneficial these slips are, so, What are you waiting to do?
