How do you do this? Well, the game has a level increase system through points, which varies from the racers that you can obtain by completing cups, or pipes in a limited time, to the planned karts that you can update.
There are some very basic things to make more points, such as have the best performance when winning racesHowever, today we will be discussing different ways to score points in this Nintendo video game.
Points en Mario Kart Tour are those that accumulate during a race and these are obtained depending on the player's performance. At the time of acquiring points, certain factors are taken into account, such as the position of the race, the combos made, the attacks and many other things that can be seen at the end in the statistics.
Therefore, if you use the correct karts in the corresponding circuit you will have a greater chance of earning more points. If you use the correct kart you can get up to a bonus point multiplier X2, and using the correct glider will also grant you a combo bonus X3.
As the title says, if you do different excellent combos Throughout the race, you will be able to get a higher score at the end of the race. You can also score more points by hitting enemies, by preventing them from hitting you as such, and also by doing good driving in the race.
We hope that with all the tips mentioned above you can be the best runner, and from that way to make more points in Mario Kart Tour, Tell us how you're doing! Related Posts
