So you must take into account that there is a period of protección to realms where others cannot attack them. Great, right?
Some people tend to confuse the protección of a kingdom with the restriction, which is a little different.
If you are interested in reading more about the restriction of kingdoms you can go to this articulo and read more about it.
In the global map where the different kingdoms appear, it is usually below each one if it is in protección, or in any case the protection time that remains.
When the time is up protección means the kingdom will enter a kingdom vs kingdom or in any case in a Real battle.
Battle royal on the other hand, it is an event that lasts 72 hours and allows all unprotected kingdoms to enter the 72 kingdom. However, they need a requirement, which is a ticket that costs 100.000 gems.
An important fact to take into account is that if you want to migrate to a realm that is currently under protección you can't do it, only if the kingdom you want to migrate to is older than yours today.
