Jessie's story from Brawl Stars It is, like that of almost all the characters in the game, a total mystery, however, Supercell has given some clues as to what its true origin could be, and it is something that this time we have decided to bring it for you.
Jessie is a Brawler Common, a little peasant woman with such a great intelligence that she can make dangerous cannon junk from scrap metal.
Its main attraction is in its attack, which can bounce when it hits an enemy, being able to hurt other rivals that are nearby.
From her first months of age, Jessie showed great ingenuity, playing with toys for older children.
Despite the fact that her intelligence was unattainable for most children her age, and for that reason they stayed away from her, little Jessie was happy surrounded by her mechanical "friends".
So, after a few days, Jessie decided to go in search of her brother to accompany him on his investigation.
Also, he built the stun rifle, as a defense method, just as a precaution.
